---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { series, SCHOLAR } from '../lib/data';
---
<Base title="About" section="about">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>About this archive</h1>
    <p>
      {SCHOLAR} has answered thousands of questions in Q&amp;A sessions recorded over many years.
      They are spread across hours of video, so a specific answer is hard to find. This site turns
      each answer into its own page. You can search and browse them by topic, and each page opens
      the video at the moment the question is asked.
    </p>

    <h2>This is an unofficial archive</h2>
    <p>
      It is a fan project. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by {SCHOLAR}, EPIC Masjid or
      Memphis Islamic Center. It is not a fatwa service. For a ruling on your own situation, ask a
      qualified scholar directly.
    </p>

    <h2>How the pages are made</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The audio of each Q&amp;A video is transcribed automatically.</li>
      <li>The transcript is split into individual questions, each with the time the question begins.</li>
      <li>
        Each answer is lightly edited for reading: filler words, false starts and repetition are
        removed, and Arabic terms are spelled consistently. Nothing is added and nothing substantive
        is removed.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Mistakes can still slip in. The video is always the source: if the text and the video
      differ, trust the video.
    </p>

    <h2>Sources</h2>
    <ul>
      {series.map((s) => (
        <li><a href={`https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=${s.playlist.id}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{s.playlist.title}</a></li>
      ))}
      <li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@YasirQadhi" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Yasir Qadhi on YouTube</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@EPICMasjid" target="_blank" rel="noopener">EPIC Masjid on YouTube</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@MemphisIslamicCenter" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Memphis Islamic Center on YouTube</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
